Performace Testing code.

This code is adapted from the main program and is used to track the
input lookahead required to generate output digits.

There are also perl scripts here for generating graphs for xgraph and
xfig to illustrate these.

The code is largely uncommented and has not been comprehensively
tested. Feel free to hack around if you like and see what I've done,
but there are no promises about anything here.
